            "end": 88,
            "text": "Ps. 121:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 119,
            "end": 122
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "It is vain for you to rise up early, to sit up late, to eat the bread of sorrows: for so he giveth his beloved sleep.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 111,
            "end": 116,
            "text": "TG Sleep."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5
          },
          {
            "start": 82,
            "end": 85
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Lo, children are an heritage of the Lord: and the fruit of the womb is his reward.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 12,
            "text": "TG Birth Control; Family, Patriarchal."
          },
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 28,
            "text": "TG Marriage, Fatherhood."
          },
          {
            "start": 75,
            "end": 81,
            "text": "TG Reward."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
